OL,3,GNEWSAClosed NCP will 'hurt' city
OL,4,Abusinesses at Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of a theatre in Leicester has
OL,7,Fsaid he is worried the continued
OL,8,Fclosure of a key car park will leave
OL,9,Fbusinesses in the city struggling in
OL,10,Fthe run-up to Christmas.
OL,12,FThe former NCP multi-storey, in Rutland
OL,13,FStreet, has been closed since March,
OL,14,Fand Chris Stafford, the chief executive
OL,15,Fof next-door Curve, said it was an
OL,16,Fongoing problem.
OL,18,F"Christmas should be a bumper time for
OL,19,Fbusinesses in the cultural quarter, but
OL,20,Fthe closure [of the car park] will hurt
OL,21,Fthem," Stafford said.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
